name: Restore unprepared study cases, baseline, passes and partial name cursor after an owned crash
size: 120x36
cwd: @TMP_TARGET
env-unset: ANTHROPIC_API_KEY OPENAI_API_KEY KUZUSHI_MODEL KUZUSHI_LANGGRAPH_BRIDGE NODE_OPTIONS NO_COLOR SEMGREP_APP_TOKEN SEMGREP_AGENT_TOKEN
env: HOME=@TMP_HOME KUZUSHI_SKIP_ONBOARDING=1 KUZUSHI_REDUCED_MOTION=1 SEMGREP_ENABLE_VERSION_CHECK=0
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/study_checkpoint.py @TMP_TARGET @ART @TMP_HOME seed
require-wrapper-flow:
launch: --target @TMP_TARGET
require-live-snap: 30 KUZUSHI | ready
submit: setg ui.auto_open_activity false
submit: setg ui.auto_open_viz false
submit: logs
submit: run context:build {"enrichment":false}
require-live-snap: 35 Build project context: | context-prepared
submit: use threat-model
submit: options threat-model:import
submit: set path .kuzushi/manual-context.json
submit: set activate false
submit: set label Common policy context
submit: run threat-model:import
require-live-snap: 35 threat-model:import saved | context-imported
submit: map
require-live-snap: 25 SYSTEM SUMMARY | map-result
nav-mode:
keys: u
require-live-snap: 25 Map ✓ | accepted-map
submit: use sast
submit: options sast:scan
submit: set taskMode manual
submit: set tasks semgrep
paste-file: @ART/rule-setting.txt
keys: Enter
submit: set semgrepTimeoutMs 60000
submit: scan batch
require-live-snap: 25 PLAN A STUDY | fresh-study
keys: Down Down Down Enter
require-live-snap: 25 CHOOSE STUDY CONTEXT | common-picker
keys: Enter
require-live-snap: 25 CONTEXT SUMMARY | common-inspection
keys: b
require-live-snap: 25 CONTEXT CASES | baseline-case
keys: n C-u
type: Baseline policy
keys: Enter
require-live-snap: 20 CONTEXT CASES | named-baseline
keys: p C-u
type: 2
keys: Enter
require-live-snap: 20 2 passes | baseline-two-passes
keys: Enter
require-live-snap: 25 CONTEXT SUMMARY | selected-baseline-inspection
keys: Escape
require-live-snap: 20 CONTEXT CASES | inspection-return
keys: a Enter
require-live-snap: 25 CONTEXT SUMMARY | candidate-base
keys: e
require-live-snap: 20 EDIT CONTEXT COPY | copy-editor
require-live-snap: 20 ↑↓ Enter edit | copy-fields-ready
keys: Enter C-u
paste-file: @ART/candidate-context.txt
keys: C-s
require-live-snap: 20 REVIEW CONTEXT CHANGES | candidate-diff
keys: Enter
require-live-snap: 25 Edited copy saved | inactive-copy
keys: Enter
require-live-snap: 25 Owner context for harmless | candidate-inspection
keys: +
require-live-snap: 20 2 cases | candidate-case
keys: n C-u
type: Owner draft α
keys: Home Right Right
require-live-snap: 25 Study choices saved locally | checkpointed-study
ask: Does the field show local durability while leaving the case label, finite plan and spending approval uncommitted?
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/study_checkpoint.py @TMP_TARGET @ART @TMP_HOME crash
require-exit: 10
env: HOME=@TMP_HOME KUZUSHI_SKIP_ONBOARDING=1 KUZUSHI_REDUCED_MOTION=1 NO_COLOR=1 SEMGREP_ENABLE_VERSION_CHECK=0
launch: --target @TMP_TARGET
require-live-snap: 30 KUZUSHI | restarted
submit: scan batch
require-live-snap: 25 RECOVER STUDY DRAFT | saved-study
expect: 2 cases
expect: 5 passes
resize: 160x48
live-snap: recovery-160x48
resize: 96x89
live-snap: recovery-96x89
resize: 80x24
live-snap: recovery-80x24
resize: 60x20
live-snap: recovery-60x20
resize: 40x12
require-live-snap: 20 RECOVER STUDY DRAFT | recovery-40x12
expect: ▸
expect: Enter restore
expect: Esc back
ask: Can an operator choose a saved study at every size, with visible controls and no implicit restoration or approval?
resize: 120x36
keys: Enter
require-live-snap: 25 NAME CONTEXT CASE | recovered-name
expect: Owner draft α
keys: Delete
require-live-snap: 25 Ower draft α | exact-cursor
require-live-snap: 25 Study choices saved locally | recovered-checkpoint
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/study_checkpoint.py @TMP_TARGET @ART @TMP_HOME edited
keys: Enter
require-live-snap: 20 CONTEXT CASES | recovered-cases
expect: Baseline policy
expect: Ower draft α
expect: 5 fixed jobs
keys: Escape
require-live-snap: 20 PLAN A STUDY | recovered-form
keys: Down Down Enter
type: 1
keys: Enter Down Enter
type: 1
keys: Enter Down Down Down Down Enter
require-live-snap: 20 CONTEXT CASES | finite-cases
keys: L
require-live-snap: 35 Matrix draft ready | fresh-plan
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/study_checkpoint.py @TMP_TARGET @ART @TMP_HOME prepared
ask: Are the original context references, baseline, unequal pass counts and investigation retained, while a fresh plan still requires explicit allowance approval?
keys: C-c
require-exit: 10
